   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgery was uncomplicated and the patient tolerated the \nprocedure well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=1989-2066",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient received perioperative IV antibiotics.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2067-2113",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Postoperative course was remarkable for the following:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2115-2169",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1.  borderline hypotension -> BP meds held",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2171-2213",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was initially controlled with a PCA followed by \na transition to oral pain medications on POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2215-2327",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient \nreceived lovenox for DVT prophylaxis starting on the morning of",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2329-2405",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2407-2413",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The foley was removed on POD2 and the patient was \nvoiding independently thereafter.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2415-2499",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The surgical dressing was \nchanged on POD#2 and the surgical incision was found to be clean \nand intact without erythema or abnormal drainage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2500-2642",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient \nwas seen daily by physical therapy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2643-2691",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Labs were checked throughout \nthe hospital course and repleted accordingly.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11269455-DS-14:chars=2692-2767",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of \ndischarge the patient was tolerating a regular diet and feeling \nwell.",
